texts = Array[String](["Final round! We've added sodium hydrogen carbonate and hydrochloric acid!
They aren't enzymes, they are a base and acid respectively. ", "You see the orange strip? That's a universal indicator. Click it to user it. It turns a dark orange in acids and a dark green in bases. ", "Identify and label the solutions: 
amylase, protease, lipase, maltase, mucin, sodium hydrogen carbonate and hydrochloric acid"])

